  "sourceInterpretation": [
    "launchLandscapeBoardDetail uses the DEBUG board-detail environment route, waits for the navigation bar/name/map existence, then assertMap checks viewport bounds and immediate hittability. It does not open an external URL or dismiss a system alert.",
    "assertMap preserves checks for map, a hold marker or boardModel.3d hittability. These failed while a modal obstructed the app. Viewport bounds and dimensions did not produce failures in this run.",
    "BoardModelSurface async loading placeholder is non-hittable by design. Although that makes a readiness wait a possible general test design choice, loading is not the observed cause here: native boards are visibly rendered in the recordings.",
    "The prior invalid runtime URL confirmation is a plausible residual source, but the archive does not prove the modal\u2019s originating request. This causation is an inference, not an observed tree fact."
  ],
